            Instrumented a nine-stage ad-index pipeline with Protobuf, Kafka,
            and Schema Registry filter logs, enabling self-service analysis of
            why approximately 97% of ad sets are filtered.
          </li>
          <li>
            Re-architected a Kotlin, S3, MySQL, and MongoDB media-processing
            pipeline with Grafana monitoring, improving latency by 90% and
            scaling to more than 2,500 daily tasks while reliably serving
            176,000 existing GIF ads.
          </li>
          <li>
            Automated a NetSuite billing workflow, reducing daily data-entry
            time from eight hours to ten minutes and allowing the accounting
            team to focus on higher-value analysis.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-entry" aria-labelledby="otso-role">
