            Kubernetes, gRPC, PostgreSQL, and Drone CI/CD.
          </li>
          <li>
            Refactored a trading-performance calculation system with incremental
            computation and Redis caching, improving response time across 13
            REST APIs serving 5,000 trading signals.
          </li>
          <li>
            Led development of a Python and React trading-bot deployment service
            in collaboration with a five-person engineering, product, and design
            team.
          </li>
          <li>
            Engineered a Flask backend for quote buffering, trading-bot
